WEBVTT

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:05.580
Our home is such a nice place.

00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:07.970
Oh, good morning.

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:11.490
Father! Good morning.

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:14.230
Did you sleep well?

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:15.200
Yes.

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:17.670
Well, that's good.

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:18.990
Oh yeah.

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:21.790
I'll make some tea for you this morning.

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:24.150
What? Um...

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:30.170
Here. Your tea.

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:40.470
Th-Thank you for the tea.

00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:47.640
Well? How is your work going?

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:49.590
Oh, I'm managing.

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.850
Eigetsu-kun and the others are also waiting.

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:54.560
I'll work hard as well.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:04.650
Shuurei.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:05.790
I love you.

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:11.460
I will love only you. Forever.

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:21.840
I won't change.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:24.680
Yes. I know.

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:26.680
But even then...

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:28.370
Yes.

00:03:29.990 --> 00:03:32.510
Even then, for all eternity...

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:55.500
Emperor.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:06.070
Please behave yourself, Emperor.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:09.580
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:11.770
I just remembered something.

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.400
Honestly.

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:15.550
You're like this every day.

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.520
Even if you say that...

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:21.650
Shuurei was really cute back then.

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:23.400
Emperor.

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:26.200
I know.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.990
I've done my work.

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:29.570
Well, yes...

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:31.760
Shuurei did a good job in Sashuu.

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:37.950
She has more problems to tackle now, so I have to do my part too.

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:39.500
I knew you could do it, Emperor.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:45.880
The female servants are saying that you've become even smarter and more beautiful lately.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:50.940
I'd be happy if Shuurei said that about me.

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:54.890
Is Kouyuu taking the day off?

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:58.320
He's seeing a visitor today, so he'll be late.

00:04:58.550 --> 00:05:00.960
Oh. It's a new year, after all.

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:03.070
You may go now.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:05.570
You must have that devil's party to go to.

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:07.520
What party?

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:10.450
You're always running away.

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:12.740
Emperor!

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:17.250
Emperor. Did you look at the portraits I gave you recently?

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:20.280
They are all very lovely women!

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:23.020
Which one of them do you prefer?

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:24.190
Oh, well...

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:25.450
I haven't looked at them yet.

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:28.460
I have brought you more portraits today.

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:29.370
What?

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:32.840
Emperor, I don't care which girl you choose.

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:35.250
Please choose one for us to bring to the palace.

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:37.980
Sh-Shuuei...

00:05:38.890 --> 00:05:39.480
Huh?

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:44.570
You're right.

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:49.240
As a newly crowned ruler, I can't afford to run away anymore.

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:52.910
But...

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:56.990
I don't want to pick one yet!

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:58.250
Emperor!

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.250
He ran away again.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.250
Well then, Father, I should get going soon.

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:09.130
I see.

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:12.920
It's a new year, but I can't afford to take it easy.

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.620
What are you talking about? I don't mind.

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:15.940
Oh! Seiran!

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.200
Are you going out?

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:17.950
Where-

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:20.650
Oh! I can't keep Yuushun-san and the others waiting!

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:22.720
See you later, Seiran!

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:26.960
She's in quite a hurry.

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:31.870
Master.

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:39.440
She never needed me at all, did she?

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:44.500
We are the ones who need her.

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:46.920
Yes.

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:52.890
She prefers to be useful to others, rather than to depend on others.

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:58.060
She became a public servant to protect others. Now she wants to help others more than ever.

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:02.610
Somehow, that reminds me of how I used to think.

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:04.400
How you used to think?

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:05.770
Yes.

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:09.960
I was always alone.

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:13.280
Ever since I was little.

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:24.320
The only one who stuck by me...

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:27.990
was my youngest brother.

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:32.170
You and the others in Sashuu took me in.

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:34.200
Seiran!

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:38.750
Ever since then, I thought I was protecting her, but...

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:43.940
You, Shuurei, and I are family.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:47.610
We always were, and we always will be.

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:50.210
Oh, that reminds me.

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:56.690
I heard that the Grand Shogun Haku has invited you to come to his party.

00:07:57.050 --> 00:07:58.370
Why don't you go?

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:00.240
The devil's party...

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:04.300
No, isn't it a party with the Urin Army's elite men?

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.620
It's acceptable to blabber all you want after drinking.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.540
It's also acceptable to vent your frustrations and complain.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.960
They'll listen to your concerns.

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:17.970
That army of drunks would?

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:20.770
You're too uptight.

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:25.440
There's nothing stopping you now.

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:29.020
You've already left me along with Shuurei.

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:31.830
Please don't forget this.

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:35.060
You are always welcome here. This is your home.

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:39.560
So please relax, and think about what you want.

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:46.420
Somehow, you're not very good at doing that.

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:48.390
Yes.

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:52.890
Kurou-sama.

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:55.090
I've been waiting for you.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:09:00.050
I'm sorry I had to come so suddenly, Kouyuu.

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:01.340
Not at all.

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:04.890
We couldn't talk much at the last party.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.590
I suppose not.

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.900
I enjoyed that party.

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:15.990
I should've visited you in person, but I didn't want to bother you when you had so much work.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:17.910
I understand.

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:22.410
It seems that Rei ani-ue doesn't like me.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.430
Oh... No.

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:28.340
I am glad to see that you are well, Kurou-sama.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:31.810
Are Akuei-sama and Seira-sama also doing well?

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:33.320
Kouyuu.

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:39.180
How many times do I have to repeat myself?

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:40.380
But...

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:42.080
You don't have to be so formal about my children.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:44.370
Despite what my family says, you're Rei ani-ue's son.

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:47.600
If you're proud of it, you shouldn't act like that.

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:51.110
You should be proud of your accomplishments.

00:09:59.940 --> 00:10:01.340
Now then, Kouyuu.

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:03.490
I'll be frank.

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:06.830
Are you ready to continue Rei ani-ue's work?

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:15.790
I feel that you're the most suitable person to lead the Kou family.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:22.020
If you're ready to take on all of Rei ani-ue's responsibilities,

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:27.640
I will do everything in my power to assist you and appease the family.

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:30.920
However...

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.360
I will do so on one condition.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:36.930
You must marry Shuurei.

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:40.950
What?!

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:53.890
Future head of the Kou Family Shuurei-dono!

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.440
Sai Rin-san.

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:04.990
I was just on my way to the Merchants Guild.

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:07.230
You'll have to cancel your plans.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:07.720
Huh?

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:13.100
I was on my way to the palace to tell you, but I'm glad I ran into you.

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:18.990
A representative from the Merchants Guild just passed a message on to me.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:22.450
The elders have some urgent business and must leave at once.

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:23.560
I see.

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:26.870
To make a long story short, they ran away from us.

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:32.730
I see.

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:35.710
I feel tired all of a sudden.

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:39.080
You were so energetic just a few minutes ago.

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:41.460
You looked pretty tense to me.

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:42.530
What?

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:43.670
I did?

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:46.710
I think I might have been trying too hard.

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:55.090
If these negotiations with the Merchants Guild fail, I think the agreement in Sashuu will fall through.

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:57.550
Don't worry.

00:11:57.550 --> 00:12:00.650
I'll continue the negotiations with the Merchants Guild.

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:01.940
All right.

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:02.740
I'm depending on you.

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:05.160
So, what will you do now?

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:09.040
If you want to return to the palace, we can escort you there.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:10.920
Let me think...

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:11.960
What should I do?

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:14.840
I've got some free time now, but I don't know what to do.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:17.390
Should I go back home?

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:20.050
I talked about this with Rin earlier, but...

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:23.970
if you don't mind, could we come by your house?

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:28.090
I would like to pass on my best wishes to your father for the new year.

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:30.340
Oh! My father?

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:31.740
I'm sure he'll be delight-

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:36.830
What's the matter?

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.960
Oh, no. It's...

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:39.630
Um...

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:41.500
Is this a bad time?

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:44.520
No! Th-Th-That's not it, but...

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:47.430
My father is still at the palace.

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:49.680
He won't be home until this evening.

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:51.590
Then let's visit him this evening.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:53.550
Well, Rin?

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:55.660
That's a good idea, darling.

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:02.800
I-I'm looking forward to it.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:39.210
Whoa!

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:42.580
Up there!

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:55.240
I justified it to myself because I've been so busy lately, but...

00:13:56.820 --> 00:13:58.850
I let things get like this again!

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:00.150
Here too.

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:01.510
And here!

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:04.780
How on earth did this happen?

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:10.240
Isn't this summer attire?

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:12.700
How long have things been like this?

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:16.470
I knew I had to do something about it, but...

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:24.040
Okay! I'll clean this up!

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:45.570
Again?!

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:50.900
You're finally here, Shuuei.

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:55.660
Grand Shogun Haku!

00:14:57.170 --> 00:14:58.880
You can't escape.

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:03.640
Seiran!

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:09.260
I think you've gone too far.

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:13.710
I missed on purpose.

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:14.560
Yeah.

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:15.940
Of course you did!

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:19.680
If you have any complaints, please tell them to that high and mighty guy over there.

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:23.130
We've been ordered to capture you, Ran-shogun.

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:25.420
Capture?

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:26.800
I'm not a wild animal.

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:29.600
You try to get out of coming to this party every year.

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:30.670
It's so impolite.

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:36.370
But I've always donated lots of the Ran family's sake in lieu of attending, haven't I?

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:38.970
Huh? Then all this sake is...

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:41.870
This here is Ran-shogun's bribe, is it?

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:44.000
Th-That's a terrible way to say it!

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:46.380
Well, drink up! Drink up!

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:52.240
I'll have you join our drinking contest later!

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:56.180
Did something happen, Seiran?

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:00.280
You don't normally drink this much.

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:03.220
Nothing in particular.

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:05.780
Here you go.

00:16:06.220 --> 00:16:07.460
That's fine then.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:11.540
Kouyuu!

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:13.930
Please let me have some too.

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:17.630
Another lost lamb, huh?

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:24.500
I've finally cleaned up this room, but...

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:27.920
They'll be here soon.

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:31.950
My father and Seiran are still off wandering somewhere.

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:33.510
I'm home!

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:42.200
Well, I met Seiran and the others on the way back from the palace.

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:43.950
Have you been drinking?

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:45.270
Yes, we have.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:47.270
What's wrong with that?

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:50.460
Th-That's not what I meant, but...

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:51.860
We've had quite a lot to drink.

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:53.690
Quite a lot.

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:57.580
Was Ran-shogun with you too?

00:16:58.010 --> 00:16:59.700
We were at a party held by the Urin army.

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:03.650
This guy can't hold his alcohol, but he wouldn't listen to us and kept on drinking anyway.

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:04.830
Excuse me...

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:06.210
Y-Yes?

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.320
Are you all right?

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:15.980
Shu! Shu-Shu-Shu-Shu... Shuurei!

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:17.090
Um...

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:20.350
Please come in and rest.

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.050
Kouyuu-sama!

00:17:41.010 --> 00:17:42.300
Please come-

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:46.910
I-I'm so sorry!

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:48.780
I was just cleaning up.

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:51.440
Please bear with me a moment.

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:57.320
Father, Seiran! Yuushun and his wife will be coming here soon.

00:17:57.640 --> 00:17:59.410
Will you please help me clean up?

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:01.380
I will do so on one condition.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:04.930
Marry Shuurei.

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:15.340
There. Tidy it all up.

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:15.870
Yes, ma'am.

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:18.060
Seiran, you clean the kitchen.

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:19.090
Yes, ma'am.

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:23.290
Now, Father-

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:26.090
What happened?

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:29.220
I tripped over the water bucket.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:33.090
Sh-Shuurei!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:34.490
Father!

00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:35.250
What-

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:38.250
I'm almost done.

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:52.690
Rushing will only make things worse.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:53.470
Water... water...

00:18:53.470 --> 00:18:54.400
H-Hey!

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:56.570
Where are you going?

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:58.340
Hey, you.

00:18:58.340 --> 00:18:59.430
You'll get lost again.

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:01.070
Huh?

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:05.240
Water... water... water...

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:03.110
What happened here?

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:04.690
How did you know?

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:08.180
You don't get lost after you drink?

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:09.830
Kouyuu?

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:14.170
Th-That's sake!

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:21.250
Geez, now I have even more work than before!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:46.410
You don't need to help me anymore.

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:48.990
All of you! Don't move an inch!

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:51.400
Oh, man! It's already dusk!

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:55.260
Please stay here and be quiet!

00:19:57.610 --> 00:19:59.190
Geez, all she does is nag.

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:01.990
She doesn't have to treat us like dead weight.

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:03.490
H-Hey.

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:06.680
No one's going to marry a girl like her.

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:07.590
Oh, well...

00:20:07.590 --> 00:20:08.560
Did you...

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:12.100
just say something?

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:17.170
I can't clean the house with you around.

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:20.230
Just keep out!

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:31.660
Oh, you should've seen the look on your face, Shuurei-dono!

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:34.160
You looked like you were chasing off a flock of pigeons with a peashooter.

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:36.160
Oh, pardon me.

00:20:36.930 --> 00:20:39.650
I'm sorry you had to see me in such a state.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.420
I'm so ashamed.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:42.940
Don't worry about it.

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:47.930
I'm glad I got to see that side of you, Head of Kou.

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:51.540
Women tend to be more influential in our family.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:53.770
That's one of our traditions, too.

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:56.850
Well then, let's start from scratch.

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:03.370
It has been a long time, Shouka-dono.

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:07.620
Thank you for your hospitality and support in Sashuu.

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:09.280
I cannot express how grateful I am.

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:12.540
This is Sai Rin, my wife.

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:16.360
Shuurei told me all about what happened in Sashuu.

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:19.290
You must have had such a difficult time.

00:21:19.810 --> 00:21:22.290
Thank you for your kind words. They warm my soul.

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:25.820
I wish I could have shown you the skill she displayed in Sashuu.

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:27.950
She pacified the crowd.

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:31.050
I never expected that from her.

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:34.600
And such a young girl is...

00:21:38.050 --> 00:21:41.750
As you can see, she's a very brave girl.

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:44.710
Excuse me...

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:49.530
It's New Year's, but this is all we have.

00:21:50.270 --> 00:21:52.070
If you don't mind...

00:21:54.630 --> 00:21:55.650
It's no problem at all.

00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:58.500
Your manjuus are more than I could have hoped for.

00:21:59.180 --> 00:22:02.160
I've been looking forward to tasting them again.

00:22:09.280 --> 00:22:12.950
So, how has your work been going recently?

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:16.950
There haven't been any problems lately. It's proceeding smoothly.

00:22:16.950 --> 00:22:20.180
I'm going to keep working hard, so I'm counting on you.

00:22:22.310 --> 00:22:24.090
He's taking a short break.

00:22:28.900 --> 00:22:30.850
Well, thank you so much for having us.

00:22:42.600 --> 00:22:45.170
It finally feels like the New Year.

00:22:45.970 --> 00:22:46.620
Yes.

00:22:47.110 --> 00:22:47.880
I suppose so.

00:22:48.650 --> 00:22:49.630
Yes.

00:22:50.270 --> 00:22:52.640
We'll be busy again starting tomorrow.

00:22:53.940 --> 00:22:57.640
Say, I wonder how Eigetsu-kun and Kourin are doing.

00:22:58.590 --> 00:22:59.850
I wonder...

00:24:46.790 --> 00:24:50.300
Oh! It's been so long since I've been home.
I can finally relax!

00:24:50.800 --> 00:24:52.380
But I can't relax too much.

00:24:52.760 --> 00:24:53.980
I've gotta do what I've gotta do.

00:24:54.590 --> 00:24:56.800
Now I'll concentrate and work hard!
